%%begintext justify
''John Burks 1821''.
A music manuscript, presumably English,
a photocopy of which was given to Andrew Kuntz in North America some years ago.
Nothing of its history is known other than what can be gleaned from the photocopy itself.
%%endtext
%%begintext justify
Original transcription into ABC by Andrew Kuntz.
Edited for the VMP with permission
Sept 2024
%%endtext

