C:"Song"
N:The melody is the Irish jig "Kinnegad Slashers"
N:Burks tune takes its name from '''The Irishman in London;
N:or, the Happy African''' (1793) by English dramatist William
N:Macready (1755-1829), although there was no music in the play.
